		"ask": "Write `pub fn npv(cash_flows: &[f64], rate: f64) -> f64` (financial: npv). Calculates Net Present Value given a vector of cash flows and a discount rate. cash_flows: Vector of f64 representing cash flows for each period. rate: Discount rate as an f64 (e.g., 0.05 for 5%)",
		"code": "pub fn npv(cash_flows: &[f64], rate: f64) -> f64 {\n    cash_flows\n        .iter()\n        .enumerate()\n        .map(|(t, &cf)| cf / (1.00 + rate).powi(t as i32))\n        .sum()\n}\n",
